{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "5092d476a5b42905897d269520ebd57d80af7592081341ac1f92acddedfae44a", "ja": "息の仕方", "zh": "呼吸的方法", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "17a25b740af30fa6072b2764a9ae9bf681acdc3f054f1afd1330329ca6ef8d59", "ja": "これまでを振り返っているアイドル達。\n星梨花は、ユニット結成時まだ体力のなかっ\nた自分に海美が秘密特訓をしてくれたことを\n話し、海美はダンスの方向性で志保と衝突し\nてしまったことを思い出す。", "zh": "正在回顾至今经历的偶像们。\n星梨花讲起了组合成立时还没有体力的自己，\n海美为她进行秘密特训的事，海美则想起了\n自己曾因舞蹈方向和志保发生冲突的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1000_033sih", "source_sha256": "f8f660bd913eb8c83e0c7dd79a10b6062a8ad9cdb1753f30103f2363458aa2a5", "ja": "えっ？　「イヤです」って……。可奈、\nプロデューサーさんにそんなこと言ったの！？", "zh": "诶？你说“不要”……可奈，你对制作人说了那种话！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "008362968b29221f595c728b91e428b631371cf92a22870f7eee35c38522a75d", "ja": "え、えへへ。たしか「イヤです！　……かな？」\nだったような～？", "zh": "诶，嘿嘿。我记得好像是“不要！……大概吧？”来着～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "e1ff5ad3cecd27293e769264840e26e80ea4b4bfb7e2fdcb92c67cbc1f7ce8ea", "ja": "同じでしょ。あきれた……。", "zh": "还不是一样。真拿你没办法……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "b4cc90f487c4eb424784778297142933d066a11e018f1a73df20ef3e835d22bc", "ja": "でも、本番中にまつりんがお願いしてくれて、最後に\nかなりんもデビューできたもんね！　よかった～☆", "zh": "不过，正式演出时小祭拜托了我们，最后可奈也成功出道了嘛！太好了～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1004_405bcp", "source_sha256": "5530c66f67e916b14462498c7c611e5e9a612f3fa476f42ca66536e6983939d4", "ja": "ま、あれが4人にユニットを組んでもらおうと思う\n切っ掛けの一つにもなったしな。", "zh": "嘛，那件事也成了我想让4个人组建组合的契机之一。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1005_033sih", "source_sha256": "80a70437d2e1ce5da8ceb09e2c0d6349db71f94bb3f6a79e405f51938dfefd11", "ja": "ユニット……。決まってからも、最初は大変でしたね。\n誰も海美さんのダンスについていけなくて。", "zh": "组合……。决定下来之后，最开始也很辛苦呢。\n谁都跟不上海美的舞步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "47e275d3151d5de42bddae1f2a8b1a7f4d9d53aec0c08ffd6272effa269d0698", "ja": "わたし、秘密特訓してもらえなかったら、\nついていけなかったかもしれません……。", "zh": "如果不是有人带我进行秘密特训，我可能也跟不上大家……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "f0d75f31e16da105c3760e356cdb39b246077c30eb70c0f9607cc871ece98a46", "ja": "せりりん……。\n息を吐く特訓しよう！", "zh": "星梨花……。\n来做吐气训练吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1008_022ser", "source_sha256": "053ae917d74137d85cafb57b43538c038903213c9d82ce789e40cda6cd61cbc8", "ja": "はい？", "zh": "什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1009_029umi", "source_sha256": "af84dd48c2a5c2c24701da89cc06e22536348e48065f8e7dc61a092b5f50b4ce", "ja": "せりりん昨日レッスンのとき、\n「息吸って！」って注意されてたでしょ。", "zh": "星梨花，昨天练习的时候，被提醒说“吸气！”了吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "c151d5ad7927e2dc666810928e9f3cb683047eceac2b18f60febe7d10b33662d", "ja": "ダンスに必死になると、いつも普通にしてるはずの\n息を吐いて吸うこと、忘れがちになってね。", "zh": "一跳起舞拼尽全力，就很容易忘记平时本该自然进行的呼吸。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1011_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d951ee4342f7d5bdfe454871d87e310328acdcf5b86254fda5494d2e84b1dd6", "ja": "それだけで、疲れたり苦しくなっちゃうんだ。", "zh": "光是这样，就会容易感到疲惫、喘不过气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "d622aa65d4aee74503b5d11b3336cdac7642d2e73454fc6cee948c1a6dfa5704", "ja": "それにキチンと息を吐くことで、\n体の軸が安定してよろけにくくもなるんだ。", "zh": "而且，好好呼气还能让身体的轴心更稳定，不容易失去平衡。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "93c747fadfa58e48c2312a10950ea3e41cd65502900ace1494fd4d3a2422dc09", "ja": "新体操やバレエしてる人がやってる練習なんだよ。", "zh": "这是练艺术体操和芭蕾的人会做的练习哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1014_022ser", "source_sha256": "dddb397faead7b3e31b69c8fafa94979cce3526b54995cd9d1190fac815f77ea", "ja": "息を吐くのに練習があるなんて、\nわたし初めて知りました。", "zh": "我还是第一次知道，连呼吸都有专门的练习。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1015_029umi", "source_sha256": "8a0c2785e1c07f695ef0f8c6f5735fe36254d9da301ebbec8023669689f0806d", "ja": "きちんと息を吐ければ、\nバテたりよろけたりしにくくなって……", "zh": "只要能正确吐气，就不容易累得气喘吁吁或站不稳……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "2fff6226ec2fee5d68a8c74f8f8398fee8f352bdf79de9654f682e940938d96e", "ja": "せりりんも、\nもっと楽しく踊れるようになると思うんだ！", "zh": "我觉得这样一来，世莉琳也能跳得更开心了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1017_022ser", "source_sha256": "59d1cbbbb0d5fec2023cf7d2d2583e4dbe4fc103e4fe196422edfff0d28ab0c0", "ja": "特訓のおかげで、少しずつですけど体力もついて、\nみなさんについていけるようになりました。", "zh": "多亏了特训，虽然只是一点一点地，我的体力也增强了，现在已经能跟上大家了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1018_022ser", "source_sha256": "10ce2fd97a47ec03b0294d1d9f2139baa6d757def0d3d8ab924e71092b83727e", "ja": "だから、わたしが今もCloverにいられるのは、\n海美さんのおかげだと思います♪", "zh": "所以，我觉得自己现在还能留在Clover，都是托海美姐姐的福♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "f8af5c2140276c20785c801aceede4b2b1a14739aa4b02ca0ce23be4657322ed", "ja": "お、おおげさだよ～。私はただ、\n頑張ったら頑張った分だけ、楽しいって。", "zh": "太、太夸张啦～我只是想说，努力多少，就能收获多少快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1020_029umi", "source_sha256": "dee5de76995d6729244ca0636058c91d7113d07e03b62369b29895757bf95c45", "ja": "それはアイドルもバレエも同じなんだって、\n伝えたかっただけ。", "zh": "我只是想告诉你，偶像和芭蕾也是一样的，付出多少努力，就能收获多少快乐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1021_029umi", "source_sha256": "802071f995ea006e62e2e5873bc81cc5f0b0df8e567f6deed84c033ff35940f1", "ja": "だって私は、Cloverのお姉ちゃんだから！\n……。でも……。", "zh": "因为我是Clover的大姐姐嘛！\n……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "66148e7fa98ff8dcfc3bf5ed25d360d0b466d8e4a9c3bd520c8c3ff4ff35b22d", "ja": "はあはあ……。海美……さん……。\n今のダンス、いつもと違いましたよね。", "zh": "哈啊……哈啊……海美……小姐……。\n刚才的舞蹈，和往常不一样吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "25571b7f0ce025bdfde4046d52ea5a1813291d2c6cbe15921bef7891f6d74679", "ja": "私たち3人の実力なら……。海美さんの……\nダンス……に……。", "zh": "以我们3个人的实力……海美……\n跟上……她的……舞步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1024_033sih", "source_sha256": "16396cb84dea9f267f9c36f4f5776c0af0c69da8b406d6769b7f6a05c80807c4", "ja": "合わせられても8割くらい……サビだけは完璧に……\n合えば充分すぎると思っていました。", "zh": "就算能跟上，也就8成左右……原本以为只要副歌能\n完美配合上，就已经绰绰有余了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "44c62863fa8f91d0cdf0cce83c13817f9197463ee5d6babf97e4b68796971bdd", "ja": "だけど……\n今みたいに海美さんの全力に1曲丸々……。", "zh": "可是……像刚才那样，整整1首歌都跟上海美小姐的全力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "902a7a96a8110bafa486c3cd7fac3c0bc7942416d5c6358ad0261c29c24a152a", "ja": "最後まで完璧についていけるのは\nさすがに……おかしい……です。", "zh": "能从头到尾完美地跟上……\n这……也太……不正常了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1027_029umi", "source_sha256": "4882719f2b16b2251446a3718d6605eeb9856d1b5103acfb8ee043c1576563e2", "ja": "今のが私の全力だよ。\n……。", "zh": "刚才那就是我的全力了。  \n……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1028_029umi", "source_sha256": "6bc4ec4852bb6bf0ba7df4ea07311db4e47569961a1cab3b597a18bbd5067edc", "ja": "私はかなりんやしほりん、せりりんと\n楽しく笑っていっぱい踊りたいの。", "zh": "我想和可奈、志保、星梨花一起开心地笑着，尽情跳舞。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1029_029umi", "source_sha256": "fcb1d2ffebcdcf3ab0bc4736408ff853d4c192060537571b48801224cd149491", "ja": "だからこれが私の考えた、\n今できる全力ダンスだよ。", "zh": "所以，这就是我思考后得出的、现在能做到的全力舞蹈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1030_033sih", "source_sha256": "832c48a77824321833e37cbbade0b2943b6437eb7a84b98380f36842c336b38f", "ja": "そんないいわけ！！", "zh": "这种借口！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1031_033sih", "source_sha256": "3a2069cb2985d8d15201c2531326e0a767a53bf5877978ca6df51a8114c399ed", "ja": "（私たちは海美さんほどダンスが上手じゃない。\nだけど、それでもいいステージのために必死で……！）", "zh": "（我们没有海美那么擅长跳舞。但是，即便如此，为了呈现一场精彩的舞台，我们也在拼命努力……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1032_033sih", "source_sha256": "66d806ddfd2fc1cb86b7d34c31a3aecec9edee3a8c6b8f244ddf75247cf7bb8a", "ja": "（今の海美さんのダンスでさえ\n息が乱れる私たちだけど……！）", "zh": "（光是跟着现在的海美跳舞，我们就已经气息紊乱了……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1034_033sih", "source_sha256": "90ad5c1b59e716cbd55755aba1101dbe9af8a52646a54dd62168bb70cefb8b52", "ja": "（息が乱れてるのは、私だけ……！）", "zh": "（呼吸紊乱的，只有我一个人……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1035_029umi", "source_sha256": "0866b41648be0cf66e85f8017c21c3240e273a70719e9d56d8adb0f1de66b18f", "ja": "私、みんなのことを考えてるつもりで……\nみんなを信じ切れてなかった。本当にごめんね。", "zh": "我以为自己一直在为大家着想……\n却没能真正相信大家。真的很对不起。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1036_033sih", "source_sha256": "257fbc5870142b38edf58aab4618155f180e5ae4727c93de0ac1f385d1b2a0cf", "ja": "い、いえ、私の方こそすみませんでした！\n私が1人で焦って……勝手に、思いつめてしまって。", "zh": "不、不用道歉，我也很对不起！\n是我1个人太着急……自顾自地钻了牛角尖。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0335_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0335_story_03_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "259b1475e6d226f8a9bd22adc12a73ff799712c4302c9311eb050e54d8258294", "ja": "大事なものを……。\n一番大事なものを、見失ってしまって……。", "zh": "把重要的东西给……\n把最重要的东西，给忽视了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
